You all know that with a random chance (once in the 121 times) an empty wand
will zap *once* more.
What you probably did not know is that when you zap a wand of cancellation
over an object, becomes unknown (to you) again and is made EMPTY!
Of cource this means that the wand will zap *once* more with the same random 
chance!!
Nice to know when you've got a wand of wishing, together with a wand of
cancellation. The only problem is it will take some time...
